      "text": "This six-day private itinerary takes you to Bogotá and La Macarena. In the capital, explore the historic La Candelaria district and visit the Gold Museum, the Mint and the Botero Museum. Then take a charter flight to La Macarena, the starting point for excursions in Sierra de la Macarena National Park and to Caño Cristales."
